            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Fold 辭 in employment-date detection**\n\nFresh evidence beyond the repaired traditional date glyphs is that `王甲於2026年1月辭職` receives `source_relation_unresolved`, while the equivalent `辞职` form passes. The cue grammar already treats `辞职` as an employment event, but this detection-only map omits `辭`, so valid traditional-source employment dates become unusable; fold this glyph without changing the original evidence or offsets.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
          }
        ]
