            "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308160112",
            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Align all supported date-boundary suffixes**\n\nFresh evidence beyond the repaired `從`/`後`/`間` wrappers is that candidates such as `2026年1月以前`, `2026年1月之后`, and `2026年1月为止` still resolve as `unregistered_position` when the registered event anchor is the inner `2026年1月`. These suffixes are explicitly accepted by the production `dateInterval` grammar, so the scorer records valid predictions as an FP plus FN; allow the same `以前/以后/之前/之后/为止` boundaries in this containment check.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "thread_id": "PRRT_kwDOVApLyM6ttJgj",
        "path": "lib/material-fact-arithmetic-review.ts",
