            "createdAt": "2026-10-18T18:21:12Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308160118",
            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reject lexical doubling operations**\n\nWhen the anchored amount is followed by a lexical doubling instruction, `normalizeMoneyValueV4('4000元翻倍')` and `normalizeMoneyValueV4('4000元加倍')` both return exact `4000.00`. In these expressions 4000 is the operand rather than the resulting amount, just as it is in the already guarded `4000元的两倍` form; recognize bounded `翻倍`/`加倍` suffixes as arithmetic so the base amount is not exposed as exact.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
          }
        ]
      },
